  theme  very-peri  classic-blue  cerulean  emerald  greenery  illuminating  mimosa  tangerine  living-coral  peach-f…  
  The color of the prompt arrow, selection marker, focused input and command names, on top of any theme. theme keeps    
  the theme's own. The arrows cycle Pantone-inspired names (approximations); enter types your own: #rrggbb, #rgb,       
  rgb(255, 111, 97), rgb(100%, 44%, 38%), hsl(5, 100%, 69%), cmyk(0, 56, 62, 0) or cmyk(0, .56, .62, 0), oklch(0.7      
  0.15 30). A color too faint on the theme's background is lightened or darkened until it reads (4.5:1).                
